A||||11||Cooter||It's alive. . . ALIVE!!!!!!!!||||1||
Z||000000||Cooter||06-02-2000||06:55 PM||||The 3.4 is in. It did crank and run with no smoke, no knocks and had VERY GOOD oil pressure for a 70,000 mile motor.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Dcp01094.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Dcp01093.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Dcp01091.jpg"> <P>Yes, those are Camaro exhaust manifolds. Right now the car is at the muffler shop getting a set of true dual exhaust. I know what your thinking- Are Camaro headers in the future? Yes they are!||||reg||1
